{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOL","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約珥書","commonName":"約珥書","title":"約珥書","order":29,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"b7dcc5db4dcd3ce09a891b7715e7031d7b27bfe3dc62d09644d1c538a20dd57e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":73},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是耶和華對毗土珥的兒子約珥所說的話。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["嚴重的蝗災"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"長老們啊，要聽此言！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"此地所有的居民啊，要留心聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你們或你們祖先的時代可曾發生過這樣的事？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要把這事告訴你們的子子孫孫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"傳到世世代代！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"蝗蟲吃剩的，蝻子來吃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蝻子吃剩的，蚱蜢來吃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蚱蜢吃剩的，螞蚱來吃","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"醉酒之徒啊，醒過來哭泣吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"貪杯的人啊，哀號吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們再無美酒可飲了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有一群強大的隊伍侵犯我的國土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠們不計其數，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有雄獅的獠牙和母獅的利齒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠們毀壞我的葡萄樹和無花果樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剝光樹皮，然後丟棄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只留下光禿的樹枝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"我的子民啊，你們要哀哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像身披麻衣的少女哭她的未婚夫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華殿中的素祭和奠祭都停止了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"事奉耶和華的祭司都哀傷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田園荒廢，遍地淒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五穀盡毀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也沒有新酒和油了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"農夫啊，你們要憂傷！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"照料葡萄園的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要哀號！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為田間的大麥和小麥全毀了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葡萄樹枯死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無花果樹凋殘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"石榴樹、棕樹、蘋果樹等田野的一切樹木枯乾。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人間的歡樂消逝了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"祭司啊，披上麻衣痛哭吧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在祭壇前事奉的人啊，要哀號；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我上帝的僕人啊，要披上麻衣過夜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為再無素祭和奠祭獻到你們上帝的殿中了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你們要宣佈禁食的聖日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"舉行莊嚴的聚會，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"召集長老和當地所有居民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到你們的上帝耶和華的殿中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向耶和華呼求。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"那日可怕呀！耶和華的日子近了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那是全能者施行毀滅的日子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們親眼看著糧食斷絕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們上帝殿中的歡樂消失。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"種子在土裡腐爛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五穀枯死，倉庫荒廢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"穀倉被拆毀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"牲畜哀鳴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牛群因無草場而彷徨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羊群也受苦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，我向你呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為火焰吞滅了曠野的草場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烈火燒光了田野的樹木。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田野的走獸向你呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為溪水已經枯乾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"火也燒盡了曠野的草場。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"「蝗蟲、蝻子、蚱蜢和螞蚱」四個希伯來詞語的確切意思很難考證。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}